{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一段大号白字，字号最大、亮度最高，位置也最靠前；随后容易转向下方第二段同样醒目的白字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正处在两个人的亲近相处中，暂时不想考虑以后，只想舒服地停留在当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、略带陶醉。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他中途曾想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这样的相处，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，但没想好怎么开口，念头很快淡了。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两段大号白字都比较醒目，第二段会分走主视线。\",\n    \"第一段句子较长，核心落点在后半句，需要扫到后面才能完整拿到。\",\n    \"第二段包含想表达喜欢、想确认对方心意、又没能开口几个层次，快速扫读不容易全部获取。\",\n    \"两条彩色辅助文字都是连续短语排列，进一步获取细节需要挑读。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "617cc388-e98e-4f4c-b720-0d0c3f058282", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030510859880Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:06:01.258039+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2e1723cfcbc216fcfe5301a3c3cb3f6087e6da19712c03a0066e971bf80e2cba", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422